      106.8,
      381.19,
      285.72,
      421.76
    ],
    "text": "My Reference No. 4/1/\u0d89/\u0d85\u01ae\u0db4\u01ae/80. Reference No. of the Ministry of Lands and Parliamentery Reforms: 4-3/9/2015/WS/28.",
    "fonts": [
      "IskoolaPota,Italic",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.9994001388549805,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      420.8,
      286.44,
      515.36
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give Notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the Government intends to acquire the following land, which is required for a public purpose. Description of the land to be acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.039495944976807,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      516.56,
      286.41,
      630.08
    ],
    "text": "The allotment of land called \u201c Kongahamula Watta and Asliyadda\u201d in total extent of about 0.0316 Hectares, depicted as Lot No. 220 in Cadastral Map No. 420214, Block No. 01 out of Block No. 02, Sheet No. 5, dated on 30.12.2017, surveyed and certified by the Surveyor General, situated at the Village of Idangapola, in Narampola Grama Niladhari Division, No. 725, in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Mallawapitiya, in Kurunegala District, North Western Province and bounded as follows.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      636.08,
      286.44,
      692.52
    ],
    "text": "SCHEDULE 1. Lot No. 220 \u2014 Name of Land : Kongahamula Watta and Asliyadda \u2014 Extent of the Land : 0.0316 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      331.28,
      357.48,
      352.88
    ],
    "text": "Boundaries :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      353.14,
      539.43,
      379.28
    ],
    "text": "North by: Land Lot No. 187; East by : Land Lot No. 1; South by: Land Lot No. 189; West by: Land Lot No. 219",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.119687795639038,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      380.72,
      541.85,
      586.16
    ],
    "text": "Names and Address of the claimants : 1. Kristogu Baduge Karunarathne No. 94, Maha Veediya, Kanthale. All Persons interested in the aforesaid land are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing before me at the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Office at Mallawapitiya on 28th February 2018 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 21st day of February 2018, the nature of their interests in the land, particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.039495944976807,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
